Semiclassical cycle construction & Physical periodic rays with stability and phase data & Typically \(e^{-sT_p}\) together with orbit amplitudes and phases & It may provide a controlled approximation only after its regime and errors are specified; equality with either exact determinant is not claimed. \\
Exact quantum multiple scattering & Boundary-channel data and disk-to-disk translation operators & Wavenumber-dependent translation kernels and boundary conditions & Its determinant is an exact quantum object. Shared collision labels permit comparison, not equality of weights, spaces, or determinants. \\
